WEBVTT

00:07:56.867 --> 00:08:00.746
emotionally induced
symptoms in animals

00:08:00.746 --> 00:08:06.650
ranging from monkeys to flamingos,
from to deer to rabbits,

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:09.708
since the 1970s.

00:08:10.968 --> 00:08:14.334
How many human lives 
might have been saved

00:08:14.334 --> 00:08:17.939
if this veterinary knowledge
had been put into the hands

00:08:17.939 --> 00:08:21.845
of E.R. docs and cardiologists?

00:08:23.055 --> 00:08:25.517
Self-injury.

00:08:25.517 --> 00:08:29.652
Some human patients 
harm themselves.

00:08:29.652 --> 00:08:33.352
Some pluck out patches of hair,